/*
 * Every player-flyable ship hull in Elite Dangerous, as Frontier's shipyard
 * registry: the internal symbol and the display name.
 *
 * Source:  EDCD FDevIDs, shipyard.csv
 *          https://github.com/EDCD/FDevIDs
 *          Community-maintained Frontier id/name registry. No explicit licence
 *          is stated; consult the repository terms.
 *
 * Each record is { symbol, name, entitlement? }. `symbol` is the internal
 * identifier (e.g. `Empire_Trader`); the journal names a ship's type by
 * its lower-cased symbol in the `Ship` field (`empire_trader`). `name` is the
 * display name (e.g. `Imperial Clipper`). `entitlement` is present only when the
 * hull is gated behind a DLC or purchase grant, carrying Frontier's raw token.
 *
 * Full provenance: data/ships/SOURCES.md.
 */
